# LightGBM's model parser is line-ending sensitive: it reads a `.txt` artifact
# line by line and a trailing \r makes every tree header fail with
# "Model format error, expect a tree here". Git's core.autocrlf=true (the
# Windows default) converts these on checkout, so a clone that CI trains and
# pushes as LF becomes unloadable locally while `git status` stays clean.
# Mark them as not-text so no conversion ever happens, in either direction.
models/*.txt -text
